Z||000009||FieroSTETZ||06-12-2000||01:00 AM||||the 2 sounds are fairly mixed up- only the first 15-20 seconds of sound 1 are the SE, all the rest (except for a short burp of import 4cylinder) are the GT with the flowmaster. sound clip 2 is actually the sound from some footage taken from a chase car. a friend and i drove around about 2 hours, me in my fiero, him in his maxima, doing drivebyes (cruise by his car at high speed) and neat distance chase shots. if anyone is interested, i am working on capturing all this video and trying to make it realmedia, so i can post it on my website. glad ya like the sounds! when i get a chance i will record some sounds of the v-8 beetle project (engine starts and runs, but we are looking for a tranny... its my dads pet project)||||reg||1
